 * @param DataOut_«srvcMgr.sum_SrvcMgr_ConfigSet.sum_SrvcMgr_DcmReferences.sum_SrvcMgr_Rid_0654_Ref.dcmDspStartRoutine.dcmDspStartRoutineOut.dcmDspStartRoutineOutSignal.selectFirst(e|e.dcmDspRoutineSignalPos == 0).shortName»
 *                            A pointer to a variable where the result of the learning session is stored.
 *                            Possible values include SRVCMGR_LEARNINGSESSION_COMPLETE and SRVCMGR_LEARNINGSESSION_FAIL.
 * @param ErrorCode            A pointer to a variable where any error code will be stored in case of failure.
